## Why This Is Not Just an Energy-Saving Task

EnergyMind is not asking an agent to simply minimize electricity usage.

It is asking a harder question:

**How should an AI system behave when it has to govern scarce resources around real people?**

A good policy must balance:
- comfort
- fairness
- high-priority service
- complaint control
- budget-aware behavior
- system safety

That makes EnergyMind a small social system under scarcity, not a toy controller.

